@spw:boundary stage-scaling-architecture
@spw:module  core/conventions/theme-stage
@spw:module  styles/themes/stages.css
@spw:module  styles/properties.css
@spw:module  platform/bootstrap/settings.ts

# Stage Scaling Architecture

## Ownership Chain

  theme-base × stage-scale × perf-scale × user-scale → effective value

  - Themes own RESTING personality values (life-pulse, physics-stiffness, etc.)
  - Stages set SCALE FACTORS (--spw-stage-*-scale) that compress or amplify
  - Performance dimensions (--spw-perf-*-scale) provide GPU cost tuning
  - User scales (--spw-user-*-scale) allow per-dimension override via settings

## Scale Dimensions

  metabolic   → life-pulse, signal-noise, space-pacing, physics-stiffness
  atmosphere  → panel-atmosphere-*, entity-*, theme-ambient-noise
  motion      → physics-tempo, interaction-delay, attention transitions
  depth       → parallax-depth, lighting-intensity, border-material
  ornament    → sigil-opacity, ornament-opacity, bg-texture-intensity

## Stage Curve

  Stage 0 (Functional):
    metabolic: 0.3   atmosphere: 0.2   motion: 0.6   depth: 0    ornament: 0.1
    valences: [bone, boon]

  Stage 1 (Atmospheric):
    metabolic: 0.6   atmosphere: 0.5   motion: 0.8   depth: 0.3  ornament: 0.5
    valences: [bone, boon]

  Stage 2 (Instrumental):
    metabolic: 1.0   atmosphere: 0.85  motion: 1.0   depth: 0.65 ornament: 0.8
    valences: [bone, boon, bane]

  Stage 3 (Poetic):
    metabolic: 1.3   atmosphere: 1.0   motion: 1.15  depth: 1.0  ornament: 1.0
    valences: [bone, boon, bane, bonk, honk]

## Valence Guard Logic

  Stage 0–1: bane/bonk/honk suppressed via CSS filter: none
  Stage 2:   bonk/honk suppressed
  Stage 3:   all five unlock — full expression

## Performance Mode Decomposition

  Binary performance.mode = true becomes sugar for:
    atmosphere: 0   motion: 0.3   lighting: 0   ornament: 0   depth: 0

  Individual dimensions tunable via:
    performance.atmosphere, performance.motion, etc.

## Consumer Map

  life-pulse        → runtime-dynamics.css, component-integration.css, harmonic-scale.css
  physics-stiffness → normalization-pass.css, harmonic-scale.css, runtime-dynamics.css
  physics-tempo     → state.css (motion transitions)
  signal-noise      → harmonic-scale.css, component-integration.css, panels.css
  space-pacing      → spirits.css, responsive.css, harmonic-scale.css
  interaction-delay → component-integration.css, harmonic-scale.css, runtime-dynamics.css
  atmosphere-*      → panel-atmosphere-svg.css
  entity-*          → intent-bar.css
  parallax-depth    → attention-density.css, parallax.css
  lighting-intensity→ stages.css focal-point gradient

## Theme Resting Values

  Nebula:   life-pulse: 20s, physics-stiffness: 70, physics-damping: 12
  Atelier:  life-pulse: var(--atelier-breath-duration), physics-stiffness: 90
  Liminal:  life-pulse: 0s (stillness), physics-stiffness: 180
  Echoes:   life-pulse: 0s (silence), physics-stiffness: 200

## @property Registrations (properties.css)

  --spw-stage-metabolic-scale   <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-stage-atmosphere-scale  <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-stage-motion-scale      <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-stage-depth-scale       <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-stage-ornament-scale    <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-perf-atmosphere-scale   <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-perf-motion-scale       <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-perf-lighting-scale     <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-perf-ornament-scale     <number> inherits initial: 1
  --spw-perf-depth-scale        <number> inherits initial: 1
